              </h2>
            </div>

            <span className="hidden text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] sm:block">
              Images from campus life
            </span>
          </div>

          <div className="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-12">
            <div className="md:col-span-7">
              <div className="border border-[#11100e] p-2">
                <img
                  src={photos[0]}
                  alt="Apex Public School"
                  className="image-print h-[520px] w-full object-cover"
                />
              </div>
              <p className="mt-2 text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">
                Photo 01 — The school community
              </p>
            </div>

            <div className="md:col-span-5">
              <div className="border border-[#11100e] p-2">
                <img
                  src={photos[1]}
                  alt="Apex students"
                  className="image-print h-[330px] w-full object-cover"
                />
              </div>
              <p className="mt-2 text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">
                Photo 02 — Learning together
              </p>

              <div className="mt-7 border border-[#11100e] p-2">
                <img
                  src={photos[2]}
                  alt="Apex school life"
                  className="image-print h-[330px] w-full object-cover"
                />
              </div>
              <p className="mt-2 text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">
                Photo 03 — Life beyond the classroom
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* =========================================================
          TESTIMONIAL / OPINION
      ========================================================= */}

      <section className="border-b border-[#11100e]">
        <div className="mx-auto max-w-[1500px] px-5 py-16">
          <div className="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.45fr_1.55fr]">
            <div>
              <p className="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#6e1722]">
                Opinion
              </p>

              <h2 className="newspaper-serif mt-3 text-4xl font-black">
                Voices of Apex
              </h2>
            </div>

            <div className="border-t-4 border-[#11100e] pt-6">
              <p className="newspaper-serif text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl">
                “A school should not only prepare students for the next exam.
                It should prepare them for the next chapter of their lives.”
              </p>

              <div className="mt-7 flex items-center gap-3">
                <div className="h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-[#11100e]" />
                <div>
                  <p className="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">
                    The Apex Community
                  </p>
                  <p className="mt-1 text-xs text-[#11100e]/60">
                    A shared perspective
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* =========================================================
          NEWS / EVENTS
      ========================================================= */}

      <section className="paper-grain border-b border-[#11100e]">
        <div className="mx-auto max-w-[1500px] px-5 py-16">
          <div className="mb-10 border-b-4 border-[#11100e] pb-4">
            <p className="mb-2 text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#6e1722]">
              School Bulletin
            </p>
            <h2 className="headline newspaper-serif text-6xl font-black uppercase sm:text-8xl">
              This Week
              <br />
              At Apex
            </h2>
          </div>

          <div className="grid gap-0 border-t border-[#11100e]">
            {[
              ["MON", "Academic Life", "Learning, exploration and classroom discovery."],
              ["WED", "Student Activities", "Clubs, activities and collaborative experiences."],
              ["FRI", "Community", "Celebrating participation, achievements and togetherness."],
            ].map(([day, title, text]) => (
              <div
                key={day}
                className="grid gap-4 border-b border-[#11100e] py-6 md:grid-cols-[90px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center"
              >
                <div className="text-2xl font-black">{day}</div>

                <h3 className="newspaper-serif text-2xl font-black">
                  {title}
                </h3>

                <p className="text-sm text-[#11100e]/65">{text}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* =========================================================
          ADMISSION BULLETIN
      ========================================================= */}

      <section id="admissions" className="border-b border-[#11100e] bg-[#11100e] text-[#f3efe5]">
        <div className="mx-auto max-w-[1500px] px-5 py-16">
          <div className="border-2 border-[#f3efe5]/70 p-5 sm:p-10">
            <div className="border border-[#f3efe5]/30 p-7 text-center sm:p-14">
              <p className="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#d8a96b]">
                Special Admission Bulletin
              </p>

              <h2 className="headline newspaper-serif mt-6 text-6xl font-black uppercase sm:text-8xl lg:text-9xl">
                Your Next
                <br />
                Chapter
                <br />
                Starts Here.
              </h2>

              <p className="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">
                Discover a learning environment built around curiosity,
                confidence, creativity and meaningful experiences.
              </p>

              <button className="mt-9 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#f3efe5] px-7 py-4 text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#11100e] transition hover:bg-[#6e1722] hover:text-white">
                Explore Admissions
                <ArrowRight size={15} />
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* =========================================================
          FAQ
      ========================================================= */}

      <section className="paper-grain border-b border-[#11100e]">
        <div className="mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-5 py-16">
          <div className="mb-10 text-center">
            <p className="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#6e1722]">
              Readers Ask
            </p>

            <h2 className="headline newspaper-serif mt-3 text-6xl font-black uppercase sm:text-8xl">
              Questions
            </h2>
          </div>

          <div className="border-t-2 border-[#11100e]">
            {faqs.map((faq, index) => {
              const isOpen = openFaq === index;

              return (
                <div
                  key={faq.q}
                  className="border-b border-[#11100e]"
                >
                  <button
                    onClick={() => setOpenFaq(isOpen ? null : index)}
                    className="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-5 py-6 text-left"
                  >
                    <div className="flex items-center gap-5">
                      <span className="text-[9px] font-black text-[#6e1722]">
                        0{index + 1}
                      </span>

                      <span className="newspaper-serif text-xl font-black sm:text-2xl">
                        {faq.q}
                      </span>
                    </div>

                    <ChevronDown
                      size={18}
                      className={`shrink-0 transition-transform ${
                        isOpen ? "rotate-180" : ""
                      }`}
                    />
                  </button>

                  {isOpen && (
                    <div className="pb-6 pl-12 pr-10">
                      <p className="newspaper-serif text-sm leading-6 text-[#11100e]/65">
                        {faq.a}
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>
              );
            })}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* =========================================================
          FINAL FRONT PAGE
      ========================================================= */}

      <section className="paper-grain border-b-4 border-[#11100e] px-5 py-24">
        <div className="mx-auto max-w-[1300px] text-center">
          <div className="mx-auto mb-8 flex max-w-xs items-center gap-3">
            <span className="h-px flex-1 bg-[#11100e]" />
            <span className="text-[8px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">
              End of Edition
            </span>
            <span className="h-px flex-1 bg-[#11100e]" />
          </div>

          <h2 className="headline newspaper-serif text-[17vw] font-black uppercase sm:text-[130px] lg:text-[170px]">
            Make
            <br />
            Your
            <br />
            Mark.
          </h2>

          <p className="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-xl newspaper-serif text-lg leading-7">
            Every student has a story waiting to be written. Start yours at
            Apex Public School.
          </p>

          <a
            href="#admissions"
            className="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#6e1722] px-7 py-4 text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white transition hover:bg-[#11100e]"
          >
            Begin Your Journey
            <ArrowRight size={15} />
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* =========================================================
          FOOTER
      ========================================================= */}

      <footer className="bg-[#11100e] px-5 py-10 text-[#f3efe5]">
        <div className="mx-auto max-w-[1500px]">
          <div className="grid gap-10 border-b border-white/20 pb-10 md:grid-cols-4">
            <div className="md:col-span-2">
              <h3 className="newspaper-serif text-5xl font-black">
                THE APEX
              </h3>

              <p className="mt-2 text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/50">
                Public School
              </p>

              <p className="mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-white/55">
                A modern school community where curiosity, character,
                creativity and learning come together.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p className="mb-4 text-[8px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#d8a96b]">
                Sections
              </p>

              <div className="grid gap-3 text-xs text-white/65">
                <a href="#stories">Stories</a>
                <a href="#academics">Academics</a>
                <a href="#campus">Campus</a>
                <a href="#student-life">Student Life</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p className="mb-4 text-[8px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#d8a96b]">
                Information
              </p>

              <div className="grid gap-3 text-xs text-white/65">
                <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
                <a href="#admissions">Admissions</a>
                <a href="/">Main Website</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 pt-6 text-[8px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/40 sm:flex-row">
            <span>© 2026 Apex Public School</span>
            <span>The Apex Chronicle • Editorial Demo</span>
            <span>Designed for the future</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  );
}